From 68e741c60b6fa475ab02dd3693ef06767f35e0d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 10:20:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add continue-watching hero to path page

Based on Figma frame 2019:85 (web-app-ui). Adapted from the raw
px/hex export onto the project's existing design tokens
(--ink, --route, .chip, .surface-card) and a responsive layout
instead of fixed absolute positioning.

- New PathHero component: progress pills, path title, and a
  spotlighted 'continue watching' video card
- Continue video = topic's selected video, preferring one already
  in progress (has a saved resume position) over the next
  unwatched one in topic order
- Reuses the VideoEmbed resume/progress-reporting work already in
  place, so the hero picks up exactly where TopicWaypoint would
- Additive: sits above the existing waypoint list, doesn't
  replace it
---
